  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia Smart Water Management Infrastructure Enhancement and Sustainable Leak Management Business Development Project(2025-2029/3,125million won)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NRW Management Training Center Establishment and NRW Management Specialist Nurturing Activities, Establishment and Operation of a Water Flow Calibration &amp; Testing Center to Strengthen Local Water Management Capacity, Enhancement of local production capacity for water leak detection IoT devices through technology transfer, Implementation of Performance-Based Water Leak Reduction Project</narrative>
  </description>
